  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</strong>Muvvas Boutique is your premier online destination for Indian ethnic apparel based in Los Angeles, California. We believe that clothing is more than just a garment; it's an expression of your identity, culture, comfort, and personality.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Product description: </strong>Our lineup of Indian clothing dresses seamlessly combines rich heritage with contemporary styles. We Offer High Quality Indian Dresses for Women including Indo Western Dresses, Lehengas, Kurtas, Sarees, Short Tops, Stylish Salwar Suits, Mommy &amp; Me and Accesories such as Dupattas &amp; Pants</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong> We make our own clothes, right from the design stage to the final stitch. Trendy and Versatile Styles, Top-Notch Quality, Fast Delivery, 30-Day Returns, Free Shipping for Orders Over $50. Custom Stitching Available on Request</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>&bull; Payment terms: </strong>Flexible, PayPal as Default</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>&bull; Other information:</strong> If you have have questions, please email us at <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"mailto:muvvasboutiquela@gmail.com\" title=\"mailto:contactus@muvvasboutique.com\" rel=\"noopener\">contactus@muvvasboutique.com</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>",
